OL,3,GNEWSA'A way to escape': Fan excitement
OL,4,Aas new ACOTAR book hits shelves
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorrential rain and high winds may not
OL,7,Fbe what many would consider
OL,8,Ffantastical.
OL,10,FBut it didn't stop about 30 hardcore
OL,11,Ffans turning out for the latest release
OL,12,Fof author Sarah J Maas' romantasy
OL,13,Fseries, A Court of Splintered Harmony,
OL,14,Fin Carrickfergus, County Antrim.
OL,16,FThe sixth book in Maas's multi-million
OL,17,Fbook selling series, A Court of Thorns
OL,18,Fand Roses (ACOTAR), was released at
OL,19,Fmidnight on Tuesday after a five-year
OL,20,Fwait.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
